  "id": 203716105244556,
  "uuid": "f59bfd16-c770-427e-9d55-84d6429fa529",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "4d52b816-d2e5-5976-6db6-5dbd826a3723",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "5054b622-e713-fb85-acd5-95ed88c75b12",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Professor Pradines is a widely recognised expert on Muslim Archaeology and teaches at ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "AKU-ISMC",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/ismc/faculty/pages/profile.aspx?ProfileID=4&Name=Stephane Pradines",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ".  He obtained his PhD from the Sorbonne and has published extensively.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Links to the documentary are avialble below with the full version available from June 14.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "https://www.arte.tv/fr/videos/072420-010-A/enquetes-archeologiques/",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.arte.tv/fr/videos/072420-010-A/enquetes-archeologiques/",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "underline"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "https://www.arte.tv/de/videos/072420-010-A/abenteuer-archaeologie/",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.arte.tv/de/videos/072420-010-A/abenteuer-archaeologie/",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "underline"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "ISMC Director, Dr Leif Stenberg commented; \"This is indeed exciting news and of course we are all looking forward to watching the full  programme on the 14th!  It's especially pleasing to have Stephane's work recognised in this way  and for his research to reach a wider audience through the medium of TV.\"",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
